face and my gun by my side\n[02:15.08] If you fuck with her heart or you fuck with my money, it's guaranteed that you will die\n[02:18.38] And these old niggas saying they better than me, but I guarantee that is a lie\n[02:22.36] Don't make me expose the old guys, lil' bitch\n[Chorus]\n[02:26.02] I see everything, ho'\n[02:29.24] I need everything, ho'\n[02:32.30] Married to the money, wedding ring, ho'\n[02:35.62] You will never get a wedding ring, ho'\n[02:39.14] I see everything, ho'\n[02:42.46] I need everything, ho'\n[02:45.54] Married to the money, wedding ring, yo\n[02:48.86] You will never get a wedding ring, yo\n[Verse 3]\n[02:52.54] Woah, tell that boy catch up, huh, ayy\n[02:55.84] He a hater, huh, that nigga actin', huh\n[02:58.04] I shoot your shit like I'm packin, oh\n[03:00.04] We get it crackin', I ain't never ever lackin'\n[03:02.92] Count the money up, I stack it, ayy, yeah\n[03:05.60] I'm in the cut, oh yeah, my niggas, they with me\n[03:08.68] Fuckin' up my body with these Xans, I have no kidneys\n[03:11.62] Runnin' like Herbo, I pull up feelin' like Swervo\n[03:14.52] Gucci all over the fur coat, this the real shit, not a merlot\n[03:17.84] Run up on me, you get murdered, yeah\n[03:19.56] I talk a lot while you murmur, yeah\n[03:21.18] All of my niggas, they beatin' it, oh, Ike Turner, yeah, woah\n[03:24.88] You niggas make me throw up\n[03:26.58] Off of the drugs, I throw up\n[03:28.28] I'm a Backwood roller\n[03:29.18] Thought it was Tuesday in the club the way I made it go up\n[03:32.88] 20K for a show, anything less, I might not show up\n[03:35.90] But I still love my fans, I just need them bands\n[03:39.54] Hahahaha, ya dig?\n[03:44.06] This a .40 cal, not a Sig, pants sag like a little kid\n[03:49.68] Not because I like it, it's because my knots big\n[03:52.92] Swine flu flow, they know my shit is too sick\n[03:56.42] I don't fuck with these niggas, they tell to the pigs\n[03:59.70] I get quick cash, choppa for your bitch ass\n[04:02.92] You a fan? Get your \"Let's take a pic\" ass, huh, yeah\n[04:07.46] Hit you like a pickaxe, but this ain't Minecraft\n[04:11.26] I count the money up, too much\n[04:12.90] Actually, I don't give two fucks\n[04:14.56] It's 20K just to show up, I make the scene then I blow up\n[04:17.94] I got the lean and I pour up, I'm in the party, get tore up\n[04:21.16] I'ma need, pour me some more up\n[04:22.78] Need you to pour me some more up\n[04:24.48] I know that I'm on top, the Rollie my watch\n[04:27.32] Glizzy my Glock, run up, get shot, ooh\n[04:29.46] I got the Juice like I'm Pac, ooh\n[04:31.06] Oh my God, you fuck with me, you gon' need God, for sure\n[04:35.80] These niggas fake like a façade\n[04:38.20] I know, I know, I know, I know, I know\n[04:44.18] To all my fans out there, go get the bands out there\n[04:47.58] Travel the world, hell yeah\n[04:49.26] Go to France like yeah, go to Japan like yeah, huh, huh\n[04:54.24] Go see it all like yeah, hm\n[04:57.52] They know I ball like shit, like John Wall like shit\n[05:00.98] I be rich like shit, could fuck your bitch like shit\n[05:04.22] I'ma get rich like shit, could fuck your bitch like shit\n[05:07.46] Pull up on the scene, .45 off my hip like shit, huh\n[05:11.18] Shoot it one time then I dip like shit, huh\n[05:14.70] Hit you in your head and your hip like shit\n[05:17.84] Ring, ring, who is this? I got a new phone\n[05:20.52] My money old as hell, I got it out the group home, yeah, oh-oh\n[05:26.84] I wonder if they think that I'll be gone before 21, uh, oh-oh\n[05:30.52] You know that I can't trust anyone so I got a gun, oh-oh\n[05:39.98] You know my niggas with me, right or wrong\n[05:42.44] Yeah, heaven or hell, oh-oh\n[05:46.66] I guess we Billy Idol comin' strong with that rebel yell, oh-oh\n[05:51.72] You know that I been runnin' up them bands, tryna get up my funds, oh-oh\n[05:59.84] You know that I been runnin' up them bands\n[06:02.28] Tryna get up my fans, tryna, oh-oh\n[06:04.98] That choppa on my